OL,3,ARegulator mistakenly sent complaints
OL,4,Aabout doctors to newspaper
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe doctors' regulator the General
OL,7,FMedical Council (GMC) has apologised
OL,8,Fafter it mistakenly sent information
OL,9,Fabout more than 220 doctors to a
OL,10,Fnational newspaper.
OL,12,FThe information included summaries of
OL,13,Fcomplaints alleging antisemitism or
OL,14,FIslamophobia against the doctors.
OL,16,FFor some of the medics involved, it was
OL,17,Fonly when the GMC alerted them to the
OL,18,Fdata breach that they discovered a
OL,19,Fcomplaint had been made about them.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
