OL,3,ARegulator mistakenly sent complaints
OL,4,Aabout doctors to newspaper
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe GMC says it is "very sorry" for the
OL,7,Fincident and has reported itself to the
OL,8,FInformation Commissioner's Office.
